    {
      "block_id": "BL-6137-4.2.02-02",
      "block_type": "worked_application",
      "heading": "",
      "text": "For a curved route, follow the route using suitable small segments or a carefully transferred measurement, then apply the valid scale. Do not measure the straight chord if the question asks for the road or river length. The estimate depends on how closely the curve is followed and the map's generalisation. A precise-looking decimal should not imply accuracy beyond the measurement and resource.",
